      "description": {
        "zh": "面向 DSH 的多项目开发工厂：以看板管理项目，每张卡派发到独立会话与 git worktree，随包提供六个阶段 skill 和一个添加项目的 skill，交付按自治档位设闸——除显式的「自动交付」档止于 draft PR 外，各档都要人工批准。",
        "en": "A multi-project development factory for DSH: manage projects on kanban boards, dispatch each card into its own session and git worktree, ship six phase skills plus a skill that adds a repository as a project, and gate delivery by autonomy tier — human approval at every tier but an explicit auto-delivery tier that stops at a draft PR."
